{"asset_key":"ep2/herohub_story_12411370","episode":"ep2","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"12411370","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1241137001:1":{"text":"死海の艦隊がラスティーアンカーに足を踏み入れた時から、あたしは奴らを根絶やしにするこの日を待っていた。","source_cn":"自从死潮舰队的人踏上锈锚港的那一天，我就等着把他们斩杀...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18E1F91F477A1C61","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1241137002:1":{"text":"犠牲になった仲間たちも、これでようやく安らかに眠れるだろう。","source_cn":"那些牺牲的血薇帮兄弟姐妹，如果知道，也会安息了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3167162737D6390F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1241137002":{"text":"犠牲になった仲間たちも、これでようやく安らかに眠れるだろう。","source_cn":"那些牺牲的血薇帮兄弟姐妹，如果知道，也会安息了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3167162737D6390F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1241137003:1":{"text":"はい。","source_cn":"是的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x62F72ABC33C32E81","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1241137005:1":{"text":"亡くなった仲間たちの顔は今でも覚えている。","source_cn":"我忘不了那些死去的兄弟的脸。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC6BC3E8BCE301F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1241137006:1":{"text":"戦う彼らから飛び散った血が、何度あたしの剣にかかったか……","source_cn":"我的剑上，曾经溅上过他们厮杀时的血。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C4C158B4D3AC93D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1241137007:1":{"text":"人間とグレイヴボーンの戦いを見たことはあるか？","source_cn":"你们见过人类和亡灵的战斗吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDEFCCC7D8795FA48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1241137007":{"text":"人間とグレイヴボーンの戦いを見たことはあるか？","source_cn":"你们见过人类和亡灵的战斗吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDEFCCC7D8795FA48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1241137008:1":{"text":"認めたくはないが、死海の艦隊のグレイヴボーンどもは、あるで疲れを知らない戦闘兵器だ。","source_cn":"虽然我不愿意承认，但死潮舰队的亡灵，简直是一群不知疲倦...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6CA36488D97CDE3A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1241137009:1":{"text":"奴らは痛みも疲労も感じず、血も流れない。そのくせ力とスピードは普通の人間を遥かに超えている。","source_cn":"他们不知疼痛，不会疲倦，不会流血，力量和速度，都比普通...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF2AE6AA20BB628C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1241137010:1":{"text":"苦労して倒しても、しばらくすれば